From: HandsomeYingyan <handsomeyingyan@gmail.com>
To: linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org
Subject: [PATCH v2] arm64:dts: add OpenStick DTS + UFI003 + disable modem by default

Changes from upstream HandsomeYingyan patch:
  - Add ufi003.dts (same GPIO as ufi001c, dual-SIM, model change)
  - Disable modem PIL (pronto_modem) by default in common.dtsi
  - Keep WiFi PIL (pronto / WCN3620) enabled — WiFi works without modem
  - Remove modem memory-region references that crash boot
  - SIM LED gpios kept but default-state = "off" (no SIM card = no need)

Signed-off-by: <local-build@armbian.org>

